{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01399","headline":"相和歌辞 神弦别曲 · 李贺","name":"相和歌辞 神弦别曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巫山小女隔云别，松花春风山上发。\n绿盖独穿香迳归，白马花竿前孑孑。\n蜀江风澹水如罗，堕兰谁泛相经过。\n南山桂树爲君死，云衫残污红脂花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01399.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01399","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}